CH2C3H7), 4.28 br.d (2H, NCH2CH=, J 5.5), 4.00 m (2H, CHBrCH2Br), 4.35 s
(2H, CH2Br), 4.70 and 4.90 d.d (2H, CH2CBr=, J 15.0), 5.75 d.d (1H, CHBr,
J 1 10.8, J 2 5.7), 6.55 t (1H, CH=CCl, J 5.7).
